[{"name":"MultiGrid","type":"structure","meta":{"uuid":"80a10100-7f08-4e64-93c4-bd628a65443d","isGlobalTemplate":false},"configuration":{"columnWidths":[3,9],"layout":{"gap":"L","marginTop":0,"marginBottom":0,"backgroundColor":"transparent"},"visible":true,"columnWidthsTablet":[12,12]},"content":[{"name":"LaccicoKategoriebaum","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"2db0e677-2c80-4aed-ab92-a4d4d9ba429d","isGlobalTemplate":false},"parent_slot":0,"slot_index":0,"content":{"anzeigen":true}},{"name":"DetailsList","type":"structure","meta":{"uuid":"d382653d-0c18-4a9b-b2c7-bcf6140a61d6","isGlobalTemplate":false},"configuration":{"visible":true,"layout":{"fullWidth":false,"caretPosition":"right"}},"content":[{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"d1660923-2b33-4f6f-99c4-0f83bb642436","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<div class=\"mb-2\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><strong>White sets a clear contrast. Creamy tones such as light beige are softer and warmer; they blend more calmly into the overall look.</strong></p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><p class=\"mb-2\">White goes best with white smooth leather and white soles. Light beige goes well with soles that have darkened over time, with natural leather, suede and canvas. Greige lies between grey and beige and suits grey and sand-coloured shoes. In the Italian R2-SL series, alongside Bianco (white) there is the creamy tone Panna (cream).</p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center d-md-none bg-light p-2 mb-2 border rounded\"><span class=\"small font-weight-bold text-dark\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-hand-o-right text-muted mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> White &amp; cream&nbsp;</span> <span class=\"badge badge-secondary py-1 px-2\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-arrows-h mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Swipe sideways&nbsp;</span></div></div><div class=\"laccico-scroll-wrapper\"><div class=\"table-responsive laccico-scroll-table\"><table class=\"table table-bordered table-hover text-left mb-0\" style=\"border: 1px solid #000000; font-size: 0.9rem; min-width: 560px;\"><thead class=\"thead-dark\" style=\"background-color: #000000; color: #ffffff;\"><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Shade</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Series</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Effect</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Suits</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">White<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Bianco for R2-SL</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-4-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F4</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-6-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F6</a></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Clear, with a strong contrast.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">White smooth-leather sneakers, white rubber soles</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Light beige<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Creamy tone</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-4-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F4</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-6-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F6</a></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Warm and soft, without harshness.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Darkened soles, suede, canvas</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Panna (cream)<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">R2-SL from Italy</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm/r2-sl\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark d-block\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2-SL</a></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Soft and creamy.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Fine Oxfords and Derbies in light leather</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Greige<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Grey-beige</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-4-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F4</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-6-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F6</a></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Calm and understated.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Grey and sand-coloured shoes, suede</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"configuration":{"visible":true,"detailsSettings":{"label":"What is the difference between pure white and cream (off-white) shoelaces?","defaultOpen":false}}},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"baba6afd-bd13-4747-a44b-dd45ad2855e9","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<div class=\"mb-2\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><strong>A soft cotton cloth removes light dust. If a white lace is really dirty or has turned grey, replace it.</strong></p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><p class=\"mb-2\">Close the cloth firmly around the lace and pull it through firmly. This also redistributes the wax, so a dull lace gets its sheen back. Washing machines and bleach are not meant for waxed laces. If you wear white laces, it is best to keep a supply.</p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center d-md-none bg-light p-2 mb-2 border rounded\"><span class=\"small font-weight-bold text-dark\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-hand-o-right text-muted mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Care &amp; replacement&nbsp;</span> <span class=\"badge badge-secondary py-1 px-2\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-arrows-h mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Swipe sideways&nbsp;</span></div></div><div class=\"laccico-scroll-wrapper\"><div class=\"table-responsive laccico-scroll-table\"><table class=\"table table-bordered table-hover text-left mb-0\" style=\"border: 1px solid #000000; font-size: 0.9rem; min-width: 560px;\"><thead class=\"thead-dark\" style=\"background-color: #000000; color: #ffffff;\"><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Situation</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">What to do</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">What it does</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Series</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Dust<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Slightly soiled</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Close a soft cotton cloth firmly around the lace and pull it through firmly.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">The dust is gone.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-4-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F4</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-6-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F6</a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Dull lace<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">After longer wear</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Pull through the cloth in the same way.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">The wax is redistributed and the sheen comes back.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-4-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F4</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-6-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F6</a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Heavy dirt<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Turned grey</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Replace with a fresh pair.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">A clean, fresh white again.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-4-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F4</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-6-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F6</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"configuration":{"visible":true,"detailsSettings":{"label":"Can waxed white shoelaces be cleaned without worry, without turning grey?","defaultOpen":false}}},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"fa267ca1-dd95-4a1c-87e2-40a531cf87d8","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<div class=\"mb-2\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><strong>The width depends on the eyelets. From 4 mm inner diameter the 4 mm flat lace fits, for example on slim leather sneakers. From 5 mm inner diameter, for example on classic court sneakers, the 6 mm flat lace fits as well.</strong></p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><p class=\"mb-2\">The lace should pass easily through the eyelet, otherwise it is put under heavy strain when it is pulled through. The 6 mm flat lace looks sporty and strong, the 4 mm flat lace slimmer. White is available in both widths, and for the 6 mm lace also as Xtra Robust in a vintage look. Light beige and greige are available as F4-CS and F6-CS.</p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center d-md-none bg-light p-2 mb-2 border rounded\"><span class=\"small font-weight-bold text-dark\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-hand-o-right text-muted mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Width &amp; sneakers&nbsp;</span> <span class=\"badge badge-secondary py-1 px-2\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-arrows-h mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Swipe sideways&nbsp;</span></div></div><div class=\"laccico-scroll-wrapper\"><div class=\"table-responsive laccico-scroll-table\"><table class=\"table table-bordered table-hover text-left mb-0\" style=\"border: 1px solid #000000; font-size: 0.9rem; min-width: 680px;\"><thead class=\"thead-dark\" style=\"background-color: #000000; color: #ffffff;\"><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Lace</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Series</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Eyelets</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Light tones</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Lengths</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">6 mm flat<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Classic Sportive</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-6-mm/f6cs\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark d-block\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F6-CS</a></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Visible eyelets, 5 mm inner diameter or more</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">White, light beige, greige</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">75–150 cm</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">6 mm flat<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Xtra Robust</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-6-mm/f6xr\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark d-block\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F6-XR</a></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Visible eyelets, 5 mm inner diameter or more</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">White</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">75–150 cm</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">4 mm flat<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Classic Sportive</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-4-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark d-block\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F4-CS</a></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Visible eyelets, 4 mm inner diameter or more</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">White, light beige, greige</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">60–120 cm</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"configuration":{"visible":true,"detailsSettings":{"label":"Which shoelace width do you choose for classic court sneakers?","defaultOpen":false}}},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"c9041d87-f630-4e0e-be5d-b753f840e9a2","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<div class=\"mb-2\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><strong>The wax penetrates the densely braided cotton. This makes the lace shape-retaining, and dirt does not settle in the fibres as easily as with unwaxed laces.</strong></p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><p class=\"mb-2\">Waxed, hot-rolled and polished, the flat lace gets its subtle sheen and feels grippy and high-quality. It lies flat on the tongue and keeps its shape even when wet. This shows especially on white sneakers: the lace looks well kept and not like a laundry tape.</p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center d-md-none bg-light p-2 mb-2 border rounded\"><span class=\"small font-weight-bold text-dark\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-hand-o-right text-muted mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Waxed &amp; unwaxed&nbsp;</span> <span class=\"badge badge-secondary py-1 px-2\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-arrows-h mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Swipe sideways&nbsp;</span></div></div><div class=\"laccico-scroll-wrapper\"><div class=\"table-responsive laccico-scroll-table\"><table class=\"table table-bordered table-hover text-left mb-0\" style=\"border: 1px solid #000000; font-size: 0.9rem; min-width: 560px;\"><thead class=\"thead-dark\" style=\"background-color: #000000; color: #ffffff;\"><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Feature</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Waxed flat lace</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Where it comes from</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Series</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Shape<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">On the tongue</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Lies flat and keeps its shape even when wet.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Dense braiding, hot-rolled.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-4-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F4</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-6-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F6</a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Dirt<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Dust, street</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Does not settle in the fibres as easily.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Wax in the braid.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-4-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F4</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-6-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F6</a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Look<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Sheen</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Subtle sheen, grippy and high-quality.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Waxed and polished.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-4-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F4</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-6-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F6</a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Bow<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">On the go</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">It holds when tied correctly. If it comes undone, it was usually a granny knot: tie the starting knot the other way round once.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">The tying technique, not the lace.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-4-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F4</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-6-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F6</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"configuration":{"visible":true,"detailsSettings":{"label":"How do waxed flat laces on white sneakers differ from unwaxed laces?","defaultOpen":false}}},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"b39eaffe-c78f-4076-8fed-605b45cd1e43","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<div class=\"mb-2\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><strong>The wax penetrates the dense braid, so dust and dirt do not settle in the fibres as easily. Even so, a worn lace does not stay completely white.</strong></p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><p class=\"mb-2\">Light-coloured laces show dirt soonest. Remove light dust with a soft cotton cloth; replace laces that are really dirty. If you prefer something less demanding in everyday use, choose light beige or greige: there the patina looks more natural.</p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center d-md-none bg-light p-2 mb-2 border rounded\"><span class=\"small font-weight-bold text-dark\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-hand-o-right text-muted mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Light tones in everyday use&nbsp;</span> <span class=\"badge badge-secondary py-1 px-2\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-arrows-h mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Swipe sideways&nbsp;</span></div></div><div class=\"laccico-scroll-wrapper\"><div class=\"table-responsive laccico-scroll-table\"><table class=\"table table-bordered table-hover text-left mb-0\" style=\"border: 1px solid #000000; font-size: 0.9rem; min-width: 560px;\"><thead class=\"thead-dark\" style=\"background-color: #000000; color: #ffffff;\"><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Shade</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">In everyday use</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Tip</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Series</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">White<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Pure contrast</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Shows dirt soonest.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Keep a supply and replace when needed.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-4-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F4</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-6-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F6</a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Light beige<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Creamy tone</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Light signs of use are less noticeable.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Good for daily use.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-4-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F4</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-6-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F6</a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Greige<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Grey-beige</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">The patina looks natural.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Nice with suede and canvas.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-4-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F4</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-6-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F6</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBotto